<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>20 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>19 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>18 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes)</p>
<p>17 - Sonny Anderson (Monaco), Anto Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>16 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>14 - Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille)</p>
<p>13 - Ibrahim Bakayoko (Montpellier), Pascal Nouma (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>12 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Miladin Becanovic (Lille),</p>
<p>Ludovic Giuly (Lyon)</p>
<p>11 - Victor Ikpeba (Monaco), Patrice Loko (Paris St Germain),</p>
<p>Jocelyn Gourvennec (Nantes)</p>
